{
  "_notes": [
    "The live text delta carries the raw `<cinna_attach>…</cinna_attach>` tag. Only the result's parts and text are stripped (snapshotParts / answerText), so a live consumer has to strip it itself (stripCinnaAttachTags has a streaming mode for this).",
    "The duplicate file id (art-f-dup) and the FilePart with no cinna.file_id (art-f-noid) emit nothing. A skipped attachment shows up only in the log.",
    "The fallback FilePart takes its name and mime from `file`, and its size defaults to 0."
  ],
